# What the language bar should say
#
# MikroDash is a Go binary serving a TypeScript frontend. Without this file
# GitHub reported it as 44% Go / 36% JavaScript / 13% TypeScript, because
# Linguist counts every .js file that is not marked, and this repository carries
# 4.1 MB of JavaScript that is never shipped and never runs in production:
#
#   3.7 MB  tools/            the verification harness -- 136 gates, 34 audits and
#                             105 corpus generators. 124 of the gates bundle the
#                             frontend TypeScript through esbuild and 86 drive a
#                             DOM to compare rendered HTML, which is why they are
#                             JavaScript and not Go: Go has no DOM, and testing
#                             TypeScript needs a JavaScript runtime.
#   205 KB  chart.umd.min.js  third-party, self-hosted because this project
#                             serves no CDN assets.
#   136 KB  recordings        frozen captures of the Node implementation that the
#                             gates compare against. Data wearing a .js extension.
#    35 KB  nodecheck/        three differential tests.
#
# (The port's own working documents were another ~700 KB of Markdown until they
# were deleted on 2026-08-31; they never counted toward the JavaScript bar.)
#
# The runtime image contains no node or npm binary and no JavaScript except the
# compiled frontend bundle, which is built from TypeScript.
#
# NOTE THIS IS PRESENTATION, NOT REMOVAL. Every file below is still in the tree,
# still maintained, and still runs on every push. `linguist-vendored` here means
# "not the product", not "not ours" -- CONTRIBUTING.md points contributors at
# tools/ on their first read, and `sh tools/verify.sh` is the documented check.

# ── The verification harness ──────────────────────────────────────────────
tools/**            linguist-vendored
nodecheck/**        linguist-vendored

# ── Genuinely third-party, vendored to avoid a CDN ────────────────────────
web/public/vendor/** linguist-vendored

# ── Recordings and build output, not hand-written source ──────────────────
#
# testdata/golden-gates/ is 127 recordings of the Node implementation;
# internal/resource/testdata/live-resources.js is a verbatim copy of the old
# resources.js frozen as a gate's oracle; web/dist/ is build output apart from
# the two lifted renderers, which are also recordings.
testdata/**         linguist-generated
internal/*/testdata/** linguist-generated
web/dist/**         linguist-generated
